(text "R6 fitted: both ADCs share SDOUT (TI scheme). R6 removed: ADC B uses its own lane SDOUT_B (MC6-30)." (at 570 420 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid dbed04fc-139b-4b39-a634-a2fe284c64d3)
)
(text "R4/R5 sit at each ADC's SDOUT pin; R7/R8 sit at the MC6 socket." (at 570 423 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3721596b-c90f-4247-8db0-cc5bec7a627a)
)
(text "FPGA PLUG J2/J3: 2x20 2.00 mm socket onto BRK8305 MC6" (at 715 71 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3788af80-faec-4c0f-afda-af59d474c23b)
)
(text "MC6 = banks 85/86 at 1.8 V, no ground pins. J3 1x20 socket onto MC9 = all GND (ground return)." (at 715 75 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5fe7860f-443b-4c0c-9242-b18c2f3cecb7)
)
(text "All signals on bank 86. Unused MC6 pins are left open (they are FPGA I/O: never tie them to GND)." (at 715 79 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fafd8fbe-0e62-4553-ab7f-cf151f4a8240)
)
(text "Check on the real BRK8305 which MC6 row (odd or even) is nearer MC9; the clock pins (BCLK 18, FSYNC 22, SDOUT 26) are on the even row." (at 715 82 0)
  (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b7db7eb7-73cd-4bf1-8fb9-90ba1c4850a0)
)
